OL,3,GNEWSASheryl Crow reveals 'incredible'
OL,4,AWelsh heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican singer-songwriter Sheryl Crow
OL,7,Fhas described her "incredible" links to
OL,8,FWales, revealing that her mother's side
OL,9,Fof the family was from the country.
OL,11,FSpeaking to Bronwen Lewis on BBC Radio
OL,12,FWales, the nine-time Grammy winner
OL,13,Frecalled visiting Wales for the first
OL,14,Ftime with her parents in about 1990
OL,15,Fwhile touring as a backing singer for
OL,16,FMichael Jackson.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
