OL,3,GNEWSASheryl Crow reveals 'incredible'
OL,4,AWelsh heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrow, best known for hits including All
OL,7,FI Wanna Do and If It Makes You Happy,
OL,8,Fsaid she did not know where exactly in
OL,9,FWales her family came from, but
OL,10,Fexpressed a desire to research her
OL,11,Fheritage further.
OL,13,F"I need to do one of those DNA things,"
OL,14,Fshe said.
